@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

InitialState : User interacts with the app
InitialState --> SettingReminder : Set Reminder
InitialState --> ManagingReminders : Manage Reminders

SettingReminder : Setting a new reminder
SettingReminder --> CheckingTimeAvailability : Input reminder details
CheckingTimeAvailability --> AddingToCalendar : Time is available
CheckingTimeAvailability --> AlertConflict : Time conflict detected

ManagingReminders : Managing existing reminders
ManagingReminders --> ViewingReminders : View reminders
ManagingReminders --> EditingReminder : Edit reminder
ManagingReminders --> DeletingReminder : Delete reminder

ViewingReminders --> [*] : View completed
EditingReminder --> [*] : Edit completed
DeletingReminder --> [*] : Delete completed
AddingToCalendar --> [*] : Reminder added to calendar

@enduml
